{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13502","headline":"经埋轮地 · 蒋冽","name":"经埋轮地","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉家张御史，晋国绿珠楼。\n时代邈已远，共谢洛阳秋。\n洛阳大道边，旧地尚依然。\n下马独太息，扰扰城市喧。\n时人欣绿珠，诗满金谷圆。\n千载埋轮地，无人兴一言。\n正直死犹忌，况乃未死前。\n汨罗有飜浪，恐是嫌屈原。\n我闻太古水，上与天相连。\n如何一落地，又作九曲泉。\n万古惟高步，可以旌我贤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋冽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13502.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13502","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}